.         // pgnation: the nationality of the responder.
.         
.         * Merge survey controls and questionaires
.         merge m:1 pid syear using "$IN/pl.dta", keepusing(plf0028 plf0029 plf0030 plf0031 plf0032 plf0033 plf0034_h)
